# Fifth Wheel March: the title. A trumpet's tune over the tuba's oom and the horns' pah, a snare marching; Bb
# major, A A' B A' (32 bars), the B section in the subdominant's colours.
title Fifth Wheel March
tempo 112
meter 4/4
swing 0

define mA
| f4/8. bb4/16 d5/4 f5/4 d5/4 | bb4/8. d5/16 f5/4 bb5/2 | a5/8. g5/16 f5/4 eb5/4 c5/4 | d5/8. c5/16 bb4/4 f4/2 |
| g4/8. bb4/16 eb5/4 g5/4 eb5/4 | f5/8. eb5/16 d5/4 bb4/4 d5/4 | c5/4 e5/4 eb5/4 a4/4 |
enddef
define mB
| g5/4 g5/8. f5/16 eb5/4 bb4/4 | c5/8. d5/16 eb5/4 g5/2 | f5/4 f5/8. eb5/16 d5/4 bb4/4 | c5/8. d5/16 eb5/4 f5/2 |
| eb5/4 eb5/8. d5/16 c5/4 g4/4 | b4/8. c5/16 d5/4 g5/2 | e5/4 g5/4 bb5/4 g5/4 | a5/4 f5/4 c5/4 eb5/4 |
enddef

part trumpet ch 1 prog 56 vol 120
$mA | c5/4. d5/8 c5/4 r/4 |
$mA | bb4/2 r/2 |
$mB
$mA | bb4/2 r/2 |

define tBb
| bb1/4 r/4 f2/4 r/4 |
enddef
